          "rid-R3"
        ],
        "summary": "The prompt embedded the diff body under a 50 KB cap. On this repo's own fn-168 change that body was 641,784 bytes, so the reviewer received ~10% of the evidence its verdict rested on and read the rest off disk anyway. fn-74 removed this and validated the removal; fn-90 and fn-159 each put it back for a good local reason, the second time with a fitter that truncated correctness-bearing evidence.",
        "taskIds": [],
        "title": "Reviewers were judging code they had seen a tenth of"
