        "summary": "The prompt shrank 70,243 to 11,824 bytes (-83.17%) on this spec's own review range. But per-dispatch telemetry across all ten review dispatches showed input tokens ABOVE the pre-change baseline, and three dispatches hit the 600s bound, so the changelog's cost and latency claims were removed rather than reframed. Full suite green, ruff clean, mirror idempotent.",
